{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to merge child amino acid catabolic terms to their parent terms.\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30202\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/18r3y_ni9-OzpYsnZ3mRsxALGUKOWmQSllJPki59G4MA/edit?usp=sharing\n\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nAspGD | 5\n~BHF-UCL | 1 - done~\nTAIR | 5\nEcoCyc | 14\nUniProt | 20\nPseudoCAP | 8\n~RGD | 5~ DONE\n~MGI | 10~ DONE\nSGD | 6 - will be done automatically\nCGD | 3 \n~PomBase | 3~ DONE\n~FlyBase | 6~ DONE\n~Reactome | 1~ DONE\n\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nInterPro2GO 8\nUniRule 19\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-01-15T17:42:27Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to specific amino acid catabolic terms", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-02-11T10:24:35Z"}
